[[File:Mutated zygomite icon.png|left]]
'''Zygomites''', referred to as '''Mutated Zygomites''' by the [[Slayer master]]s, are [[monster]]s that appear as '''Fungi''' until provoked (''Pick Fungi'') that require level 57 [[Slayer]] to damage. They resemble giant mushrooms and are found in [[Zanaris]] near the [[Cosmic Altar]] (level 86) and the furnace (level 74). Their [[Ancient Zygomite|ancient variants]] are found on [[Fossil Island]] and in the [[Stalker Den]]. Players must use [[fungicide spray]] on Zygomites once they are under 8 hitpoints to kill them.

The Fungicide spray must be reloaded every ten kills. The reloads, [[Fungicide]], can be bought from the Slayer master or obtained as a [[Drops|drop]] from Zygomites. The spray and its refills cannot be sold back to the Slayer master afterwards, so it is recommended to only buy what is needed.

Players who have been given a Mutated Zygomite [[Slayer task]] can choose to kill [[Ancient Zygomite]]s as an alternative for the task. However, if [[Konar quo Maten|Konar]] assigns the player to kill Mutated Zygomites in [[Zanaris]], then the Ancient counterparts cannot be killed for the task as they are only found on [[Fossil Island]]. Likewise, if she assigns Zygomites on Fossil Island then the player will be required to kill [[Ancient Zygomite]]s since there are no regular Zygomites on the island.

[[File:Picking fungi.gif|thumb|250px|left|A player picking a fungi.]]

{{Toc|limit=1}}

==Strengths and weaknesses==
[[File:Fungi.png|left|100x100px]]
Zygomites mostly use [[Magical melee|magic-based melee]] headbutts which can hit substantial amounts, but they occasionally use more powerful [[Magical ranged|magic-based ranged]] attacks by shooting spores. [[Karil the Tainted's equipment|Karil's]] or [[Dragonhide armour]] is strongly recommended while fighting them, as the high Magic defence will reduce the chance of them hitting you. If praying against their attacks, [[Protect from Melee]] is recommended, as their melee attacks are more accurate.
